      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Trade-offs:\n+ Better traceability and atomicity.\n+ Cleaner incident investigation.\n- Extra schema, storage and lifecycle complexity.\n- More complicated error policy than current best-effort import.",
